    It’s an old, glossy magazine. <span style="color:Pink">The cover is warped and faded, but the image depicting a half-naked boy smiling back at you makes your face instantly flush hot. You have a strong suspicion that this is an adult magazine.</span> <br>
    <br>
    Heart hammers against your ribs, you look over your shoulder, suddenly convinced that your father, a teacher, or some park ranger is watching you from the shadows. But there is no one around. <br>
    <br>
    You know you shouldn't look. You know it's a boundary you aren't supposed to cross. But you're entirely alone in the deep woods, and the thrill of a forbidden secret keeps intruding your thoughts. <br>
    <br>
